es of Na<sup>&#x0002b;</sup>, K<sup>&#x0002b;</sup>-ATPase. <source>Proc. Natl. Acad. Sci. USA.</source> <volume>99</volume>:<fpage>15977</fpage>&#x02013;15982.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12461183</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib32"><citation citation-type="journal">Pedersen, P.A., J.M. Nielsen, J.H. Rasmussen, and P.L. Jorgensen. <year>1998</year>. Contribution to Tl<sup>&#x0002b;</sup>, K<sup>&#x0002b;</sup>, and Na<sup>&#x0002b;</sup> binding of Asn776, Ser775, Thr774, Thr772, and Tyr771 in cytoplasmic part of fifth transmembrane segment in &#x003b1;-subunit of renal Na,K-ATPase. <source>Biochemistry.</source> <volume>37</volume>:<fpage>17818</fpage>&#x02013;17827.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9922148</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib33"><citation citation-type="journal">Pichon, Y. <year>1982</year>. Effects of palytoxin on sodium and potassium permeabilities in unmyelinated axons. <source>Toxicon.</source> <volume>20</volume>:<fpage>41</fpage>&#x02013;47.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6123163</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib34"><citation citation-type="journal">Rakowski, R.F. <year>1989</year>. Simultaneous measurement of changes in current and tracer flux in voltage-clamped squid giant axon. <source>Biophys. J.</source> <volume>55</volume>:<fpage>663</fpage>&#x02013;671.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2720065</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib35"><citation citation-type="journal">Rakowski, R.F., D.C. Gadsby, and P. De Weer. <year>1989</year>. Stoichiometry and voltage dependence of the sodium pump in voltage-clamped, internally dialyzed squid giant axon. <source>J. Gen. Physiol.</source> <volume>93</volume>:<fpage>903</fpage>&#x02013;941.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2544655</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib36"><citation citation-type="journal">Rakowski, R.F., D.C. Gadsby, and P. De Weer. <year>2002</year>. Single sodium ion occupancy and steady state gating of the tetrodotoxin sensitive channels in squid giant axon. <source>J. Gen. Physiol.</source> <volu